# Transient dependencies (vendored under core/nativebridge/libs/).
# NOTE: `*/libs/…` requires at least one path segment before `libs/`, so it never matched
# `core/nativebridge/libs/glm/` (two segments) or a hypothetical root `libs/` (zero segments).
# core/nativebridge/libs/glm/ is committed on purpose (it's the copy the CMake build actually
# uses — see core/nativebridge/src/main/cpp/CMakeLists.txt) so it is intentionally NOT listed
# here; these patterns are for genuinely transient/locally-fetched deps only.
core/nativebridge/libs/opencv/
core/nativebridge/libs/litert/
core/nativebridge/libs/mlkit-subject-segmentation/
core/nativebridge/libs/*.aar
core/nativebridge/libs/litert_npu_runtime_libraries/

# Legacy/Other
/app/src/main/cpp/include/glm/*

build_log*.txt
/gradle/gradle-daemon-jvm.properties
project_backup_full_*
refactor*.sh
*/build/*
*/.cxx/*

build_output*.txt
/changes.diff

.gemini/
gha-creds-*.json
/project_source_*.txt
.worktrees/
/.agent/
# Trailing /* rather than /: git never descends into an EXCLUDED DIRECTORY, so a negation
# for a path inside one is unreachable. Excluding the contents instead leaves the directory
# itself traversable, which is what makes the next line work.
/.claude/*
# ...except shared agent definitions, which are part of the project.
!/.claude/agents/
strangerdanger-494206-082913abfaab.json
